  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 4.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "right then, come on in. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.0,
      "end_seconds": 15.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "um so... pain in my breastbone wound that's why I came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.7,
      "end_seconds": 21.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.71,
      "end_seconds": 28.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "It's been about two weeks I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.99,
      "end_seconds": 33.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "okay give me more detail on it whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.15,
      "end_seconds": 53.54,
      "duration_seconds": 18.39,
      "text": "ah, um, I notice it more with coughing pretty moderate, if I'm being honest it happens a few times a day oh, and tiredness had that since last weekend i had swollen ankles before that's settled now, though"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.57,
      "end_seconds": 62.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Have you had pain in your breastbone wound before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.94,
      "end_seconds": 68.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "A bit about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.39,
      "end_seconds": 87.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "let's talk a a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.45,
      "end_seconds": 103.01,
      "duration_seconds": 14.56,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I work in accounts at a hospital. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.78,
      "end_seconds": 108.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.38,
      "end_seconds": 112.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.87,
      "end_seconds": 131.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.36,
      "end_seconds": 140.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "oh no I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.16,
      "end_seconds": 145.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.04,
      "end_seconds": 153.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "Yes, I had a a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.45,
      "end_seconds": 158.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.09,
      "end_seconds": 163.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "right I've had heart disease yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.23,
      "end_seconds": 165.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "yes, carry on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.0,
      "end_seconds": 177.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "and what about breathlessness, fever or chest pain on exertion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.16,
      "end_seconds": 184.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "I haven't had breathlessness, fever or chest pain on exertion, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.97,
      "end_seconds": 188.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.59,
      "end_seconds": 197.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "actually, no, skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.0,
      "end_seconds": 201.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.48,
      "end_seconds": 206.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Mm, you know, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.98,
      "end_seconds": 211.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.7,
      "end_seconds": 228.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.73,
      "end_seconds": 248.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 66 oxygen saturation is 97 percent pressure 126 over 75 temp 36.9 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.95,
      "end_seconds": 251.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.91,
      "end_seconds": 255.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Alright, that's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.5,
      "end_seconds": 260.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.5,
      "end_seconds": 262.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.17,
      "end_seconds": 280.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "The chest wound has healed, the breastbone is stable, and the vein-harvest wound on the leg is a little swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.05,
      "end_seconds": 293.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.58,
      "text": "you can sit up now. From what you've told me and what I found, this looks most like recovering well after bypass surgery"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.72,
      "end_seconds": 297.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.51,
      "end_seconds": 329.3,
      "duration_seconds": 29.79,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with recovering well after bypass surgery do well once it's treated properly. I'll request an ECG, it'll help with post-operative review. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with post-operative review. Walk daily, no heavy lifting for six weeks and no driving until you are cleared. I think the cardiac rehabilitation team should see you too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.42,
      "end_seconds": 331.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.33,
      "end_seconds": 340.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "we'll catch up in six weeks right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.33,
      "end_seconds": 344.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.48,
      "end_seconds": 347.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "have a good day"
    }
  ]
